			"Message": "style(Sky): Reformat README.html to use self-closing tags and stacked inline content\n\nConvert void elements (img, source) to self-closing `/>` in the hero section,\nfunding table, and logo rows. Wrap emoji spacers and inline text on\nseparate lines within heading, anchor, and strong tags.\n\nThis normalizes the HTML formatting to satisfy the project's linting rules\nwithout changing any rendered content.",
